 "sentences": [
  {
   "s": 0.0,
   "e": 4.22,
   "text": "You don't procrastinate on hard tasks, you procrastinate on unclear ones."
  },
  {
   "s": 4.58,
   "e": 9.16,
   "text": "Look at a normal to-do list, taxes, website, thesis. None of those is something you can"
  },
  {
   "s": 9.16,
   "e": 12.84,
   "text": "actually start, your brain can't see the first move so it picks up the phone instead."
  },
  {
   "s": 13.26,
   "e": 18.08,
   "text": "The fix is to rewrite each item as the next visible action. Start with a verb and make"
  },
  {
   "s": 18.08,
   "e": 22.42,
   "text": "it something you could see is done. So taxes becomes download the Marchbank statement,"
  },
  {
   "s": 23.0,
