   "text": "website becomes write the headline for the homepage, and thesis becomes write 200 words"
  },
  {
   "s": 27.82,
   "e": 32.82,
   "text": "of section 2.1. Here's the test, if you can't picture the moment it's done it's still too vague,"
  },
  {
   "s": 33.32,
   "e": 37.74,
   "text": "split it again until you can. Take the task you've been avoiding the longest and rewrite it right"
  },
  {
   "s": 37.74,
